  "$comment": "Point-in-time per-guild territory counts recovered from Wayback Machine captures of the v1 Wynncraft API guild leaderboard (public_api.php?action=statsLeaderboard&type=guild&timeframe=alltime). These are the ONLY structured territory data that exist before our territory_exchanges log begins (2018-01-03): exchange-level pre-2018 war data was never archived anywhere (the only archived territoryList capture is 2018-06-16). Sep 2016 snapshot documents the Hax-dominance era, including Libertas [Lir] at 60 territories — a major 2016 power absent from every written source. Apr 2018 independently confirms total Federation map control (all 15 holders are tribute-roster guilds, 384 territories). Later captures (2019+) overlap the exchange log and serve as validation. Additional captures exist at: 2019-04-04, 2019-05-08, 2019-06-25, 2019-07-19, 2019-12-09, 2020-01-06, 2020-03-05, 2020-03-07 (same URL pattern via web.archive.org).",
